@startuml
!pragma teoz true
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 124
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
title S05-ddd-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "ctl: IdentityController" as ctl
participant "svc: AuditApplicationService" as svc
participant "repo: AuditRepository" as repo
participant "fact: AuditFact" as fact
activate obj
obj -> ctl: 1. audit(bearer, key, input)
activate ctl
note right of ctl
Resolve principal from Bearer. The caller does not set the actor.
end note
ctl -> ctl: 2. auditActor(principal, key, audit:write)
activate ctl
note right of ctl
Check the service key and audit:write to obtain the actor.
end note
deactivate ctl
note right of ctl
Read the effective course role codes for the audit snapshot.
end note
ctl -> svc: 3. external(actor, system, roles, requestId, type, objectType, objectId, target, before, after)
activate svc
note right of svc
Validate payload fields and hash canonical JSON.
The digest binds the source system and authenticated actor to the content.
end note
note right of svc
Build the proposed AuditFact with millisecond precision.
end note
group First audit transaction (REQUIRES_NEW)
svc -> repo: 4. find(requestId)
activate repo
repo -->> svc: existing audit or null
deactivate repo
alt Known ID
svc -> fact: 5. requireReplay(proposed)
activate fact
break Conflict
fact -->> obj: 400 AUDIT_DUPLICATE_CONFLICT
||16||
end
deactivate fact
note right of svc
Keep the original audit record and ID.
end note
else New requestId
svc -> repo: 6. append(fact)
activate repo
deactivate repo
||16||
end
end
opt Retry
note right of svc
Catch DataIntegrityViolationException after the first transaction rolls back.
Concurrent insertion of the same requestId is one cause.
end note
group Read again (separate REQUIRES_NEW transaction)
svc -> repo: 7. find(requestId)
activate repo
repo -->> svc: existing audit or null
deactivate repo
alt Record found
svc -> fact: 8. requireReplay(proposed)
activate fact
break Conflict
fact -->> obj: 400 AUDIT_DUPLICATE_CONFLICT
||16||
end
deactivate fact
note right of svc
Keep the original audit record and ID.
end note
else Record absent
break Missing
svc -->> obj: Rethrow the original database exception
||16||
end
end
end
end
note over svc,ctl
Complete the audit transaction before replying.
After a timeout, retry with the original requestId.
end note
svc -->> ctl: audit record
deactivate svc
ctl -->> obj: 201 audit result
deactivate ctl
deactivate obj
@enduml